The vectors in testdata/mit-crypto.json are copied from MIT krb5,
src/lib/crypto/crypto_tests/, at the commit named in that file. They have
been reformatted (C initializers to JSON) and filtered to enctypes 17-20;
the values themselves are unchanged. The copyright notices of the source
files follow.

